# {{projectName}}

{{description}}

## Prerequisites

- Ruby 3.2+
- {{#if dbPostgres}}PostgreSQL{{/if}}{{#if dbMysql}}MySQL{{/if}}{{#if dbSqlite}}SQLite3{{/if}}{{#unless hasDatabase}}No database required{{/unless}}
- {{#if useSidekiq}}Redis (for Sidekiq){{/if}}

## Setup

```bash
bin/setup
```

## Running the application

```bash
bin/rails server    # start on :3000
```

{{#if useSidekiq}}
```bash
bundle exec sidekiq # start background worker
```
{{/if}}

{{#if useDocker}}
## Docker

```bash
docker compose up -d  # start db + redis
docker compose down
```
{{/if}}

## Commands

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `bin/rails server` | Start dev server |
| `bin/rails console` | Rails console |
| `bin/rails routes` | List routes |
| `bin/rails db:migrate` | Run migrations |
| `bin/rails db:rollback` | Rollback migration |
| `bin/rails db:seed` | Seed database |

{{#if useTests}}
## Testing

```bash
bundle exec rspec                  # all tests
bundle exec rspec spec/models      # model specs
bundle exec rspec spec/requests    # request specs
```
{{/if}}

{{#if useLint}}
## Linting

```bash
bundle exec rubocop                # check
bundle exec rubocop -A             # auto-correct
```
{{/if}}

{{#if useSwagger}}
## API Docs

Visit `/api-docs` for the Swagger UI.
```bash
RAILS_ENV=test bin/rails rswag     # generate swagger specs
```
{{/if}}

## Architecture

Standard Rails MVC API-only application.

```
app/
  controllers/
    application_controller.rb
    api/
      {{#each modules}}
      {{snakeCase this}}s_controller.rb
      {{/each}}
  models/
    {{#each modules}}
    {{snakeCase this}}.rb
    {{/each}}
  serializers/
    {{#each modules}}
    {{snakeCase this}}_serializer.rb
    {{/each}}
config/
  routes.rb
db/
  migrate/
```
